      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18830,
      "end_ms": 20070,
      "text": "是你生命的见证，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20330,
      "end_ms": 22830,
      "text": "更是照亮你人生的那束光。"
