      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24690,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "都没有比养好孩子这件事更重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27930,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "不管你有钱没钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 30760,
      "text": "永远心引导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30920,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "全力托举问心无愧就好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d7063ebdebe4b24_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33700,
      "end_ms": 35360,
      "text": "因为就这么一个心头肉啊，"
